        "FacilityTypeEN": "SWIMMING POOLS",
        "FacilityTypeTC": "游泳池",
        "FacilityDetailsEN": "Indoor Facilities :<br/>^Main pool (Length 50m x Width 25m, Depth: 1.4m-1.9m)<br/>^Training pool Length 25m x Width 15m, Depth: 1.2m-1.4m) <br/>Spectator stand (1200 seats), Electronic Scoreboard, Family changing rooms, Babycare room <br/><br/>Outdoor Facilities :<br/>Training pool 2(Length 25m x Width 30m, Depth: 1.1m-1.4m)<br/>Teaching pool (Length 25m x Width 12.5m, Depth: 0.7m-0.9m) <br/>Leisure pool (Irregular shape, Depth: 0.1 m-0.3m)<br/>Diving pool (Length 11.75m x Width 11m, Depth: 4.4m-4.6m)<br/><br/>Barrier Free Facilities: Pool Lift (Indoor Main Pool, Indoor Training Pool), Ramp (Outdoor Training Pool), Accessible/Universal Changing Rooms and Toilets, Accessible Lift, Tactile Guide Path, Visual Fire Alarm System, Braille and tactile Floor Plan",
        "FacilityDetailsTC": "室內設施: <br/>^主池 (長50米 x 闊25米，水深：1.4米-1.9米)<br/>^訓練池1 (長25米 x 闊15米，水深：1.2米-1.4米) <br/>觀眾看台(1200個座位)、電子計分板、家庭更衣室、育嬰間 <br/><br/>戶外設施: <br/>訓練池2 (長25米 x 闊30米，水深：1.1米-1.4米)<br/>習泳池 (長25米 x 闊12.5米，水深：0.7米-0.9米) <br/>嬉水池 (不規則形狀，水深：0.1米-0.3米)<br/>跳水池 (長11.75米 x 闊11米，水深：4.4米-4.6米)<br/><br/>無障礙設施: 升降台(室內主池、室內訓練池)、斜道(戶外訓練池)、暢通易達/通用更衣室及洗手間、暢通易達洗手間、暢通易達升降機、觸覺引路帶、視像火警警報、觸覺點字及觸覺平面圖",
        "OpeningHoursEN": "Winter Opening Schedule Information<br/>1st Session: 6:30 am - 12:00 nn<br/><br/>2nd Session: 1:00 - 6:00 pm<br/><br/>3rd Session: 7:00 - 9:30 pm<br/><br/>(Session breaks: 12:00 nn - 1:00 pm & 6:00 - 7:00 pm)",
